ability and performance. This advanced material is treated with DuPont®'s triple-proofing agents for enhanced water, oil, and stain resistance, ensuring superior protection against the elements.<\/li><li><strong>Internal: <\/strong>The interior features a sophisticated embossed polyester lining that enhances both structure and moisture protection, offering a refined and organized space for your essentials.<\/li><li><strong>Hardware<\/strong>: Fitted with FIDLOCK® magnetic clasps on both the shoulder strap and exterior, providing seamless, secure access with a modern, intuitive design for effortless use.<\/li><\/ul>","page":"","liquid":"","text_size":"text-sm"}},"collapsible_tab_XRpXG8":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"opened":false,"style":"with-border","icon":"ruler","heading":"Dimensions","content":"<p><strong>Capacity:<\/strong> 6L<br\/><br\/><strong>Weight:<\/strong> 580g<br\/><br\/><strong>Dimensions:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><strong>Height:<\/strong>8\" (20cm)<\/li><li><strong>Length:<\/strong> 13\" (34cm)<\/li><li><strong>Width:<\/strong> 3\" (8cm)<\/li><\/ul>","page":"","liquid":"","text_size":"text-sm"}},"collapsible_tab_yEhXY8":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"opened":false,"style":"with-border","icon":"devices","heading":"Will My Device Fit?","content":"<p>✔️ iPad mini 1 \/ 2 \/ 3 \/ 4 \/ 5 (7.9\")<\/p><p>✔️ iPad mini 6 \/ 7 (8.3\")<\/p><p>✔️ iPad 6 (9.7\")<\/p><p>✔️ iPad 7 \/ 8 \/ 9 (10.2\")<\/p><p>✔️ iPad 10 \/ 11 (10.9\")<\/p><p>✔️ iPad Air 4 \/ 5 (10.9\")<\/p><p>✔️ iPad Pro 11\"<\/p><p>❌ iPad Pro 12.9\"<\/p><p>✔️ Kindle (Basic, 6\")<\/p><p>✔️ Kindle Paperwhite \/ Signature Edition (6.8\")<\/p><p>✔️ Kindle Oasis (7\")<\/p><p>✔️ Nintendo Switch Lite (5.5\")<\/p><p>✔️ Nintendo Switch (6.2\")<\/p><p>✔️ Nintendo Switch OLED (7\")<\/p><p>✔️ Steam Deck LCD (7\")<\/p><p>✔️ Steam Deck OLED (7.4\")<\/p>","page":"","liquid":"","text_size":"text-sm"}},"collapsible_tab_9iYk8m":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"opened":false,"style":"with-border","ico