,"color_highlight":"#ffddbf","gradient_highlight":""}}},"block_order":["content-1","content-3","content-4"],"settings":{"heading":"Need help?","description":"<p>If you have any questions, you are always welcome to contact us. We'll get back to you as soon as possible, within 24 hours on weekdays.<\/p>"}},"lookbook_rrLBJF":{"type":"lookbook","blocks":{"content_teBhA4":{"type":"content","settings":{"icon":"none","iwidth":"custom","icon_width":10,"heading":"Key Leash","text":"<p>Secure your keys with an integrated key leash—no more digging around. Always within reach and safely attached.<\/p>","link":"","color_text":"#ffffff","vertical":45,"horizontal":42,"vertical_mobile":42,"horizontal_mobile":37}},"content_DLwAwm":{"type":"content","settings":{"icon":"none","iwidth":"custom","icon_width":10,"heading":"Quick-Release Magnetic Buckle","text":"<p>Snap-on magnetic buckle from Fidlock® ensures fast, one-handed access with a secure, satisfying click.<\/p>","link":"","color_text":"#ffffff","vertical":60,"horizontal":49,"vertical_mobile":52,"horizontal_mobile":50}},"content_PjLmWm":{"type":"content","settings":{"icon":"none","iwidth":"custom","icon_width":10,"heading":"Front Zipper Pocket","text":"<p>Quick-access front zipper pocket for storing small items like cards, tickets, or sanitizers—perfect for daily convenience.<\/p>","link":"","color_text":"#ffffff","vertical":37,"horizontal":55,"vertical_mobile":40,"horizontal_mobile":61}},"content_nWqHK8":{"type":"content","settings":{"icon":"none","iwidth":"custom","icon_width":10,"heading":"Hidden Flap Pocket","text":"<p>Designed as the bag’s flap, this deep pocket opens only by lifting the Fidlock-secured cover. No zipper—sealed naturally by closing the flap. Inside, two compartments keep your items organized.<\/p>","link":"","color_text":"#ffffff","vertical":47,"horizontal":54,"vertical_mobile":48,"horizontal_mobile":30}},"content_yhkPLq":{"type":"content","settings":{"icon":"none","iwidth":"custom","icon_width":10,"heading":