op":0,"padding_bottom":0,"divider":false,"full_width":true,"rounded":false}},"faq_FgMhai":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"question_QgY8Nw":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>What makes the Herman H3 different from a regular sling bag?<\/strong>","text":"<p>Unlike standard sling bags, the Herman H3 combines premium Fidlock® magnetic buckles, dedicated tech organization, hidden storage compartments, a concealed bottle holder, and professional-grade materials in a compact EDC-focused design.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question_xeHgAk":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>Is the shoulder strap detachable?<\/strong>","text":"<p>Yes. The shoulder strap is detachable and the product also includes a stabilizer strap.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question_UFX87z":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>What does the stabilizer strap do?<\/strong>","text":"<p>It helps reduce movement when walking quickly, cycling safely or using the sling in front or behind the body.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question_DPyBKR":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>What can fit inside the Herman H3, and is it suitable for photography and tech EDC?<\/strong>","text":"<p>Yes. With a versatile 6L capacity, the Herman H3 is designed for photographers, creators, and tech-focused commuters. It comfortably fits an 11-inch tablet, compact camera, Nintendo Switch, Kindle, power bank, chargers, earbuds, wallet, keys, and other daily essentials. Dedicated organizer pockets and quick-access compartments keep cameras, batteries, memory cards, cables, and accessories neatly arranged and easy to reach.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question_AQqeVG":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>Is the Herman H3 waterproof?<\/strong>","text":"<p>No,It is water-resistant for light rain and splashes.<\/p>","highlighted_text